loop_
_database_PDB_caveat.id 
_database_PDB_caveat.text 
1 
;Residues ALA K 286 and THR K 290 are linked together in the model; however, there are residues between them in the deposited polymeric sequence.
;
2 
;The distance between Residue I ASP 1332 and Residue I GLN 1336 is 15.40 Angstrom. But there are only 3 residues (not enough sequence) to cover the gap region.
;
3 
;The distance between Residue L LYS 351 and Residue L ALA 356 is 19.37 Angstrom. But there are only 4 residues (not enough sequence) to cover the gap region.
;
